---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<section id="contact" class="contact-section container" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">03 / WHAT'S NEXT?</p><h2 id="contact-title">下一个想法，从你好开始。</h2><p>欢迎交流，也欢迎一起做点有意思的东西。</p>
  <div class="contact-links"><a class="button button-dark" href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">在 GitHub 找到我 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{site.email && <a class="button button-outline" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>写封邮件 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>}</div>
</section>
